  "Resistance_Pattern" [label="(0,0,0) Induction: Given specific cases and common pattern, DarTG1 resistance is a conserved trait in Tevenvirinae not explained by AdfA"];
  "S29" [label="(29,0,0) Co-infection and chimeric virus analysis identified second anti-DarTG1 element conserved in T-even phages"];
  "S30" [label="(30,0,0) This element termed AdfN is both necessary and sufficient for phage counter-defense"];
